Table full name: mitelman-db.prod.Reference
Column name: RefNo Type: INT64 Description: reference number from 10 to 15880
Column name: TitleLength Type: INT64 Description: length of title, up to 334
Column name: TitleShort Type: STRING Description: short or truncated title, eg aThe myeloperoxidase gene in acute promyelocytic leukemia'
Column name: TitleLong Type: STRING Description: blank for shorter titles, otherwise the full title is in this field
Column name: Volume Type: STRING Description: journal volume, eg '95:96-101'
Column name: Year Type: INT64 Description: publication year, eg '1998'
Column name: Journal Type: STRING Description: journal name abbreviation, eg 'Cancer Genet Cytogenet'
Column name: Text Type: STRING Description: this field is always blank
Column name: Abbreviation Type: STRING Description: author abbreviation, eg 'Park et al 2009'
Column name: AuthorsLength Type: STRING Description: author string length, up to 2411
Column name: AuthorsShort Type: STRING Description: short or truncated author string, eg 'Atkin NB, Baker MC'
Column name: AuthorsLong Type: STRING Description: blank or complete, long author string
Column name: Flag Type: STRING Description: this field is always blank
Column name: Pubmed Type: STRING Description: PubMed identifier, if available, eg '17334343'
Sample rows:
[{'RefNo': 79, 'TitleLength': 130, 'TitleShort': 'An extra C chromosome and various metabolic abnormalities in the bone marrow from a patient with refractory sideroblastic anaemia.', 'TitleLong': None, 'Volume': '8:293-306', 'Year': 1971, 'Journal': 'Scand J Haematol', 'Text': None, 'Abbreviation': 'Hellstrom et al 1971', 'AuthorsLength': '71', 'AuthorsShort': 'Hellstrom K, Hagenfeldt L, Larsson A, Lindsten J, Sundelin P, Tiepolo L', 'AuthorsLong': None, 'Flag': ' ', 'Pubmed': '5134476'}, {'RefNo': 114, 'TitleLength': 98, 'TitleShort': 'On the specificity of the G abnormality in human meningomas studied by the fluorescence technique.', 'TitleLong': None, 'Volume': '80:812-820', 'Year': 1972, 'Journal': 'APMIS', 'Text': None, 'Abbreviation': 'Mark et al 1972', 'AuthorsLength': '27', 'AuthorsShort': 'Mark J, Mitelman F, Levan G', 'AuthorsLong': None, 'Flag': ' ', 'Pubmed': None}, {'RefNo': 32, 'TitleLength': 56, 'TitleShort': 'Identification of isochromosome 17 in myeloid leukaemia.', 'TitleLong': None, 'Volume': '(1):849-850', 'Year': 1972, 'Journal': 'Lancet', 'Text': None, 'Abbreviation': 'Lobb et al 1972', 'AuthorsLength': '29', 'AuthorsShort': 'Lobb DS, Reeves BR, Lawler SD', 'AuthorsLong': None, 'Flag': ' ', 'Pubmed': '4111610'}, {'RefNo': 106, 'TitleLength': 56, 'TitleShort': 'Marker band in one chromosome 14 from Burkitt lymphomas.', 'TitleLong': None, 'Volume': '237:33-34', 'Year': 1972, 'Journal': 'Nature', 'Text': None, 'Abbreviation': 'Manolov & Manolova 1972', 'AuthorsLength': '21', 'AuthorsShort': 'Manolov G, Manolova Y', 'AuthorsLong': None, 'Flag': ' ', 'Pubmed': '4113130'}, {'RefNo': 102, 'TitleLength': 60, 'TitleShort': 'Multiple chromosome aberrations in a lymphosarcomatous tumor', 'TitleLong': None, 'Volume': '70:243-258', 'Year': 1972, 'Journal': 'Hereditas', 'Text': None, 'Abbreviation': 'Fleischmann et al 1972', 'AuthorsLength': '46', 'AuthorsShort': 'Fleischmann T, Hakansson CH, Levan A, Moller T', 'AuthorsLong': None, 'Flag': ' ', 'Pubmed': '4